  "bodyHash": "gcj0mPBAa6U=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_61f148e5-b093-4bc4-8dc5-c0998041beeb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"398\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_30ad2e9e-f975-4fa4-81f2-f3836fad16f3.png\" alt=\"description\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\"></strong></p><p><strong>Aromatic</strong> 是一個小型模組，加入了許多實用的肉桂主題功能。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_af96ea13-d7af-4489-9c83-a6286d078e93.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"30\"> <strong>肉桂雨林</strong> 是一種較罕見的生態域，通常與叢林相鄰，是肉桂樹生長與卡德獸棲息的地方。</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_05cd41d5-af65-443b-948d-e2221ac5c8e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"> 肉桂木材</strong> 是一種全新的黃色木材種類，也擁有薄版型態。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_f052375d-9517-4683-92ef-c4676e73cfac.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\"> 肉桂樹皮</strong> 可以透過剝除肉桂原木獲得，並可熔煉作為食材使用。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_da65e626-5e19-429e-9573-c0fced53addc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"19\" height=\"30\"> 卡德獸 </strong>(<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fInternational_Phonetic_Alphabet_chart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">/kædl/</a></em>) 是一種生活在肉桂森林中的可愛動物，可以用肉桂漿果繁殖，並可使用剪刀獲得決明花。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_bb293609-ca6f-4f60-94ca-ae5e30f2ebfc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"30\"> 決明花</strong> 是一種主要用於裝飾的花卉，也可熔煉後用來獲得「嗅覺喪失」效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_e8fb9900-81ab-4ae4-bf79-adcec54391e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"23\" height=\"30\"> 嗅覺喪失</strong> 是一種狀態效果，在其持續時間內食用任何食物所獲得的飽食度都將相同。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_46099b08-eb39-4e9d-815b-34be3825846a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\"> 肉桂捆</strong> 可用來擊暈任何攻擊中的節肢動物。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_067713ce-199b-424c-928b-e69cb9716aca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"30\"> 樹皮果醬</strong> 是一張全新的唱片，可透過剝除肉桂原木獲得。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2de3b37b-58bd-45e2-8b56-25a5212b8f0f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"42\"></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cccac345-5fd1-433d-bf7f-92ad79bf975a.png\" alt=\"description\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\"></strong></p><ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3be0675d-8930-4bcd-8a8d-d5edd1dd5a4a.png\" alt=\"Arabic flag\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">阿拉伯文 <em>(由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">ItsHamza</span> 翻譯)</em></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_de12ecce-0a6e-4ea1-8d8f-9644dd6f6b18.png\" alt=\"Belarusian flag\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">白俄羅斯文 <em>(由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Quixotic Critter</span> 翻譯)</em></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_73f44160-7306-497e-bc4d-e185927512c3.png\" alt=\"Breton flag\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">布列塔尼文&nbsp;<em>(≥1.0.3)</em> <em>(由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Quixotic Critter</span> 翻譯)</em></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_69711672-ed19-4060-80fc-31c6fb8f3489.png\" alt=\"French flag\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">法文&nbsp;<em>(≥1.0.3)</em> <em>(由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Lyof</span> 翻譯)</em></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3f648d73-a04b-48f9-9cc7-3c8323f62b60.png\" alt=\"Hungarian flag\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">匈牙利文&nbsp;<em>(由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Gyula</span> 翻譯)</em></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042492/description_d7d3c3ef-467a-4e79-9191-3454bfd635d7.png\" alt=\"Spanish flag\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">西班牙文 <em>(≥1.0.1)</em> <em>(由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">DaricrahDev</span> 翻譯)</em></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c1d8db61-f241-4add-b56a-3a91d50efef2.png\" alt=\"Ukrainian flag\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">烏克蘭文&nbsp;<em>(由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Quixotic Critter</span> 翻譯)</em></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_15d32d8d-a44a-46e1-afcd-a11cfb402289.png\" alt=\"Yiddish flag\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">意第緒文&nbsp;<em>(由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Quixotic Critter</span> 翻譯)</em></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2de3b37b-58bd-45e2-8b56-25a5212b8f0f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"42\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e6446882-b603-4125-bc2f-376209796a38.png\" alt=\"requirements\" width=\"150\" height=\"15\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>GeckoLib</strong></a> 是執行此模組的必要前置。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2de3b37b-58bd-45e2-8b56-25a5212b8f0f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"42\"></p><p><strong>常見問題：</strong></p><p><em>— 這個模組會更新嗎？</em></p><p>會的，預計在2025年/2026年初；將會有完整的程式碼和紋理重製。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1207/232/cinnamon-2-0-0-png.png\" alt=\"即將到來的紋理重製預覽\" width=\"287\" height=\"289\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>— 為什麼這個模組很久沒有更新了？</em></p><p>因為個人生活事件，以及從 MCreator 轉為手動編碼的遷移過程。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>— 你會把這個模組移植到 Fabric 嗎？</em></p><p>近期內不會。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>— 你會把這個模組回溯移植到 x.xx.x 嗎？</em></p><p>不會，很抱歉。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2de3b37b-58bd-45e2-8b56-25a5212b8f0f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"42\"></p><p><strong>已知錯誤：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>會導致 Abnormals Atmospheric 模組崩潰；</li>\n<li>肉桂樹葉不會自然消失。</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
